'' An interface that names a public header's types -- a field of vq/shape's type, and a
'' pointer to vq/blob's opaque type, whose name is also the module's alias -- says it uses
'' those modules, and a program that imports it reads their headers though it did not import
'' them itself.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/vleak/libs tests/modules/src/vleak/app/uses.tiko -o tests/modules/vleakuses.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/vleakuses.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  4 9
